%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6626c84bb700413428bce8fec5aff79d, type: 3}
  m_Name: SuccessSequence
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _sameOptionTarget: 10
  _lines:
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Well, seems I've convinced her enough.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I suppose now is as good a time as any to finalize this arrangement.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I assume our time is up. Has my performance been satisfactory?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 15eaf0d869902074ab9e4727a6d818aa, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I guess you could say that. Talking to you was way more worth
      it than I thought it would be, honestly...
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4bb070eb7f25b4d43b4cd5ca28562347, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: So yeah, go ahead, say what your deal thing is or whatever.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85e73fbc318d21e4db7461e9136fd8c7, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: It would be my pleasure.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "As we both know, I've been using this bar to handle some\u2026
      business matters every now and then, yes?"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e5765cb552eb0e743b1d025dd7e12a90, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Yeah, and I've been having to stay here overtime for you guys.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85e73fbc318d21e4db7461e9136fd8c7, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: And for that I am thankful.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7221be3902993e49920b17cf290b8cb, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I couldn't help but think to myself, though, is it not unfair
      that you provide me with a service, only for me to not give anything in return?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 15eaf0d869902074ab9e4727a6d818aa, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: When you put it that way, I guess that makes sense...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: There's nothing I loathe more than an unfair trade. It's simply
      an injustice to do such a thing.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7221be3902993e49920b17cf290b8cb, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "So, I carefully deliberated on what exactly I could provide for
      you\u2026 what exactly would someone like you deserve?"
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85e73fbc318d21e4db7461e9136fd8c7, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Then it hit me. The perfect exchange.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: As thanks for your services, I propose...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "\u2026 that we engage in sexual relations."
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 051809b70c0d48749b41aef782cb1ee0, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: ?!?!?!?!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85e73fbc318d21e4db7461e9136fd8c7, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Ahaha, cat's finally out of the bag, huh?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "\u2026 y..yeah??? A big fat one at that!!!"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You want to fuck??? You???? With me??????
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I'd refrain from using such vulgar language, but yes, that is
      what I'm getting at.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e5765cb552eb0e743b1d025dd7e12a90, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Uh, yeah right, what can a bitch in a wheelchair do???!!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85e73fbc318d21e4db7461e9136fd8c7, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I'd be pleased to let you find out.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Agh\u2014whatever, just\u2014I wasn't expecting that!!! How was
      I supposed to know you had the hots for me??!!"
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7221be3902993e49920b17cf290b8cb, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Mm, not the reason why I'm extending this offer, but I will have
      to admit you are quite a sight.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: So how the hell was sex the best thing you could think of anyway??!!
      Not, like, money or anything??? Aren't you a really powerful business person
      or whatever???!!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I thought about that, but I figured that money would not be appropriate
      for someone like you.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: '"Not appropriate??" What the hell are you talking about???'
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: If you'll allow me to explain.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3493280a97932c747881f09ba5d20724, type: 3}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: 'Let me ask you this: how do you understand human worth?'
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 051809b70c0d48749b41aef782cb1ee0, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Human\u2026 worth?"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 15eaf0d869902074ab9e4727a6d818aa, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Well\u2026 isn't it just how successful you are in life or whatever?"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Some homeless bum is probably worth less than a billionaire, right?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7221be3902993e49920b17cf290b8cb, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Hmm, close...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: It's more about capability.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: One who lives in riches can be much less capable than one who
      lives in poverty.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Whether or not those capabilities have been exercised does not
      determine one's worth.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: 'Another question: do you believe in destiny?'
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Ehh\u2026 kinda sounds like a load of bullcrap."
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Or, well, if destiny was a thing, it'd make life infinitely more
      dull if I knew that everything that happened to me was supposed to happen.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85e73fbc318d21e4db7461e9136fd8c7, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: On the contrary; it makes life much more interesting.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: To know one's destiny is to know one's purpose and, thus, to know
      one's worth.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Knowing everything you're meant to be and sticking to it makes
      a truly distinguished and valuable person.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Morality, wealth, accomplishments\u2026 none of those measure
      up to one's true fate."
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: They're merely distractions we've created to hide from the truth.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: But I've seen through it all. I see through their lies, their
      cowardice, their shame.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: And I see where their destinies lie; where their value begins
      and ends.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: 'A final question:'
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: How valuable of a human are you?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 051809b70c0d48749b41aef782cb1ee0, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "\u2026 me?"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 15eaf0d869902074ab9e4727a6d818aa, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "\u2026 well, running into pure wastes of space on the daily,
      I'd have to say at least above average."
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Anything less than that and I'd have to consider restarting my
      whole life...
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8fadb01c20afe834da1f4899841afc76, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "But really, I am way more deserving of being alive than any of
      those freaks. To even IMAGINE being that worthless\u2026 eugh\u2026"
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85e73fbc318d21e4db7461e9136fd8c7, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "\u2026 pfft\u2026"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e5765cb552eb0e743b1d025dd7e12a90, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "\u2026 what's up with you?"
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: eebba17b56161c943b6184130fc22df9, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: HAHAHAHA!!!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85e73fbc318d21e4db7461e9136fd8c7, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "HAHAHAhaha\u2026 oh\u2026 oh goodness, I need to catch my breath\u2026
      wow."
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: The hell's so funny?!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Ahaha, it's just\u2026 ha\u2026 you're so\u2026"
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 37612b0b4484bb5459a86f7ae9887020, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "\u2026 incredibly wrong."
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 051809b70c0d48749b41aef782cb1ee0, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: What?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85e73fbc318d21e4db7461e9136fd8c7, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Allow me to educate you on the truth of the matter. Perhaps then
      you will also find this hilarious.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7221be3902993e49920b17cf290b8cb, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I explained to you earlier that human worth is based on one's
      capability and destiny, yes?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: How much you can and are destined to do sets your value up for
      life; an immutable value resistant to desire.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: No matter how much you want to be something, you are only what
      you're fated to be.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: And you...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: eebba17b56161c943b6184130fc22df9, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "\u2026 are not destined for anything."
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bd8324aa5017eac46bde1bad7f5bc461, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I can tell by how you conduct yourself and how miserably your
      efforts fail.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bd8324aa5017eac46bde1bad7f5bc461, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Your feeble attempts to assimilate into society, your inability
      to be loved in any capacity, the suffering you endure in your day-to-day life...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bd8324aa5017eac46bde1bad7f5bc461, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: It's clear that you aren't destined to be anything meaningful.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bd8324aa5017eac46bde1bad7f5bc461, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Your existence is pitiful and pointless, and it seems that you're
      the only one that has yet to realize that.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bd8324aa5017eac46bde1bad7f5bc461, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: But that is precisely why I recommended something as crude as
      sexual intercourse for our exchange.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bd8324aa5017eac46bde1bad7f5bc461, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Because such a lowly act as that suits someone like you perfectly.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bd8324aa5017eac46bde1bad7f5bc461, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: W-what are you talking about?? "Lowly act????"
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bd8324aa5017eac46bde1bad7f5bc461, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Sex is a means of easy transaction. Anyone can offer their body
      up to indulge in lust.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bd8324aa5017eac46bde1bad7f5bc461, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: 'Unlike money, fame, or success, it''s a completely thoughtless
      means of compensation. '
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bd8324aa5017eac46bde1bad7f5bc461, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: People destined for nothing in life just succumb to instinct and
      chase after trivial urges like lust, because it's all that they can do.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bd8324aa5017eac46bde1bad7f5bc461, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: It's up to us who rank higher than them to provide them that service
      and supplement their pathetic existence.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bd8324aa5017eac46bde1bad7f5bc461, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: And I have come to the conclusion that the only way I can repay
      you is to fulfill the desires intrinsic to your kind.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 21300000, guid: edbd6dbab5594ea4fb5cd2717510e691, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: But it disgusts me to be forced in that position. How dare your
      destiny be so cruel to make you such a useless person?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 21300000, guid: edbd6dbab5594ea4fb5cd2717510e691, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: So I've altered the conditions to maximize this opportunity I've
      been granted to reinstate your worth.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ae6e88627df7dc74b913104ee2b02e71, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Simple fornication is not enough to satiate my sheer distaste
      for you.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 13ce30486c285bc429aaa8e523f06816, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I want to destroy you from the inside out. Ruin every part of
      you until they're barely recognizable.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8cc958a73844bdf449afaf10cc219407, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: The only way I'll fuck you is if it kills you.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I will make sure that your life will end by my hands, Jessi Atwood.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 051809b70c0d48749b41aef782cb1ee0, type: 3}
