    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Oh\u2026 you are AMAZING!!!"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Haah\u2026 I've been waiting for someone like you my entire life......"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Oho..ohohoho.....the adrenaline.....it's unreal!!!
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I've never felt anything like that before...the excitement....
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You're really not anything like them...you're not boring or dull
      or a waste of time...
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You're so PERFECT!!! Aghhh...
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I want to carve this moment into my brain and never forget it!!!
      Ahaha!!!
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Ahh, fuck\u2026 my heart is going crazy...... it's so wonderful........"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You're the first person to ever make me feel this way.....to ever
      make me feel ANYTHING.....
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: All those other dumb fucks that come here are the same. They're
      all too predictable and too scared to do anything exciting.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "They just want to look and feel good by refusing to be with someone
      as worthless as me\u2026 haha\u2026 I get it now\u2026"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "You're\u2026 you're so perfect\u2026 so much better than everyone
      else......"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "To have someone care about my pathetic existence so much to want
      to end my miserable, worthless life with their own hands\u2026 haah\u2026 fuck!!!!"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 1
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: FINE!!! I'LL DO IT!!!!! PLEASE LET ME HAVE LIFE-ENDING SEX WITH
      YOU!!!!!!! SHOW ME HOW YOU'LL RIP ME APART AND KILL ME ONCE AND FOR ALL!!!!!!!!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2ba22cf812ea822458d34d49423a97c3, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...
