    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "\u2026 as you wish."
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Seems this will be much more amusing than I expected. I'm looking
      forward to seeing this deal through with you, Jessi.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Hah, yeah, whatever, just, when do we start??!! Please, I need
      it as soon as possible\u2014I need to be living the life I was MEANT TO LIVE!!!"
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Patience, my friend. We've just settled on this arrangement. Its
      execution will come further down the line.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: But, I'm all pent up right now!!! You can't just leave me like
      this!!!! PLEASE!!!!!!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85e73fbc318d21e4db7461e9136fd8c7, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You really are worthless scum, aren't you? Begging to be fucked
      so desperately...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Though, I'm going to have to make some preparations before our
      first encounter, so you have no other option but to wait.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: UGHHH BUT I CAN'T!!!!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Perhaps you need something to calm yourself down. How about we
      have a drink or two?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "OH, oh\u2014sure!!! What would you like?"
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7221be3902993e49920b17cf290b8cb, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Hmm, I can't say I'm particularly looking for a specific flavor
