  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: What I want..? Hah, okay, whatever you say!
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: She turns around and browses the shelves behind her, eyes scrolling
      through the arrays of bottles. When it seems she finally lands on one, she
      haphazardly grabs two glasses and pours a crimson liquid into each.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Jeez, is she that excited that she forgot how to serve drinks
      correctly?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Okay, I got everything!
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "One glass is placed on the counter. The other\u2014"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: FUCK!
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "\u2026 spills a quarter of its volume to a hasty landing."
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Damn it, I'm just...aghh I can't think straight right now!!!
      I'll go fill it up again, hang on\u2014"
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Just a second.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I think I have a better idea.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: '?'
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Come closer.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: She leans over the counter, careful not to get any of the pool
      of wasted liquid onto her clothes.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: But I won't allow her to be cautious.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I grab her by her collar and close the distance between us, our
      lips meeting each other in the middle.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I can feel her shock without having to look at her face. She's
      clawing onto the counter to find a semblance of balance, but my pull is stronger.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Her mouth is still, but quickly succumbs to the motions of my
      own. What a fast learner.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: It isn't long before she's fully melted into the kiss I've gifted
      her. To be expected of her pathetic nature, surrendering to such pleasures
      so easily.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: But this is far from a gift.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: '*CHOMP*'
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: '!!!'
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 22fe8749b16e9254384512b52e7d6adf, type: 3}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "My teeth waste no time sinking into her flesh\u2014her bottom
      lip becomes hopelessly ensnared."
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: She tries to escape, but I've got her beat once again. Her attempts
      to pull away only makes me bite harder, and every tug only makes the tear in
      her skin bigger.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Only when a metallic taste enters my mouth do I let go, and she
      nearly falls back onto the shelves until she manages to catch the counter.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Eyes wide, her free hand darts to her mouth to check the damage.
      I examine her wound as well, making sure I have succeeded.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: A concoction of blood and saliva run down her chin, some dripping
      onto already stained shirt. My idea has worked beautifully.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You may use that to refill your glass.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...haha...hahahahaHAHAHA! Oh, you're a fucking genius!!!
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: She grabs her glass to catch the dripping mixture, bringing it
      closer to make sure she doesn't miss a drop.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Ripples of red fall continuously into her glass until it seems
      she's satisfied, wiping her mouth with her sleeve. In accordance, I raise my
      drink.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85e73fbc318d21e4db7461e9136fd8c7, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b2efa96d31f912c4b911acf2ae44be5c, type: 3}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Here's to this new chapter.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Hell yeah!!!
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Our glasses clink and we each take a sip. For a piece of filth,
      her taste in alcohol is rather pleasant.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Hah\u2026 thank you so much, Shuron. You're what I needed in
      life."
  - _speaker: 3
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85e73fbc318d21e4db7461e9136fd8c7, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: It's my pleasure.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Once my glass is empty, I bid her farewell and take my leave.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: That truly couldn't have gone any smoother. A perfectly balanced
      transaction is one I love to see.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: My judgment has proven correct once again. It always does, because
      this is just how the world works. How people are.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: And Jessi Atwood...
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: 9959a4df59af56a44b7ca1a158fbd31b, type: 3}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "\u2026 is human trash."
  _playerReplyOptions: []
  _npcReplies: []
  _gameEnd: 0
